        :lp=/dev/tty01:\
        :mc#20:\
        :mx#0:\
        :of=/usr/lib/lpdfilters/ln03rof:\
        :pl#66:\
        :pw#80:\
        :rw:\
        :sd=/usr/spool/lpd:\
        :sh:\
        :uv=4.0:\
        :xc#0177777:\
        :xf=/usr/lib/lpdfilters/xf:\
        :xs#044000:

Thanks in advance for your help,



